{{! Shown after a member asks for their data. The file arrives by email, not in
    this browser, so the page has to say so or the member waits for nothing. }}

<div class="hero hero-sm">
  <div>
    <h1>{{page.title}}</h1>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="wrapper">
  <section>

    <p class="notice notice-info" role="status">We have emailed a download link to {{content.loginEmail}}.</p>

    <p class="text-muted">The link works once and expires in {{content.ttlHours}} hours. If it expires before you use it, ask for the export again from your profile.</p>

    <p class="text-muted">The file covers your profile, membership, email settings, clubs, event registrations, uploaded media, payment history and which votes you took part in. It does not include how you voted: the platform does not store that against your name.</p>

    <div class="form-actions">
      <a href="{{content.profileHref}}" class="btn btn-outline">Back to Profile</a>
    </div>

  </section>
</div>
